en:
//　養母――
//　養母は、何を言おうと――
  What―
  What is she trying to―

//　　　　　　殺しちゃいけないよ。
//　　　　　　一人も、殺しちゃあ駄目だ。
 
 
 
 
<center>You mustn't kill anyone.
<center>Not a single person, you hear? Not for any reason.

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0040550a00'>
//「――っ」
"...Guh..."

//　そう。
//　そうだ……
  Yes... I remember. My mother's most solemn teaching.

  One must never take a life.

//　不殺の禁戒。
//　養母の尊い教え。

//　……だが。
//　この状況！
  But... then what am I supposed to do!?

//　殺さずに、確実に、養母を救えるのか!?

  Is there any way, save by killing this musha, to ensure that my mother survives!?
